Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:05.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, guys, for the future, I don't mind killing the big spiders...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:05.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 以后我不介意帮你们杀大蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:08.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but you have to at least try with the little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:08.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你们至少要想办法对付小只的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:12.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, please. We're facing a far more serious problem than stray arachnids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.76,0:00:12.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 拜托 我们现在面临了 比蜘蛛还要严重的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, it's not that bad. -Not bad? It's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 没那么糟 -不糟？很恐怖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:20.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You hear stories about this sort of thing. You never think it will happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:20.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你曾听说过这样的事 但从没想过会发生在自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:24.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So they steamed your dumplings. Get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:24.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们蒸了你的饺子 你就忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:27.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}New topic, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:27.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 换个话题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, Penny. Let me take this opportunity to point out...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 佩妮 让我借着这个机会指出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:35.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that you are looking particularly ravishing today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:35.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你今天看起来特别迷人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:39.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not with a thousand condoms, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:39.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一千个保险套都不可能 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So there is a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以还是有个价的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:47.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. New topic, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:47.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 请换新话题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:49.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, did you hear the people in 5-A are moving out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:49.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有听说住5A的人要搬走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:52.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. Shh-shh-shh! -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:52.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:55.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-The people upstairs are moving out. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:55.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-楼上的房客要搬走了 -不要说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.93,0:00:58.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.93,0:00:58.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恐怖极了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:00.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would you just say something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:00.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么要这样说出这种事？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.94,0:01:04.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How else--? -No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.94,0:01:04.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么… -不…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How else was I supposed to say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.69,0:01:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然我该怎样说？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:11.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Slowly. Like putting a new fish in a tank. You don't just drop it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:11.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢慢地 就像把鱼放到鱼缸里 你不能丢下去就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:15.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You let the bag sit in the water a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:15.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要把袋子放在水中一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:17.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.58,0:01:17.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恐怖极了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:21.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, I'm sure it's gonna be fine. -No, it's not going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:21.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我确定会没事的 -不 不会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:25.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Change is never fine. They say it is, but it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:25.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}改变从来就不是好事 他们说是 但根本不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:28.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, did you even know the people that are moving out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:28.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你认识要搬走的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I never met them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从来没看过他们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what made them perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以他们才很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:34.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There were no awkward hellos in the halls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.55,0:01:34.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在走廊见面时不用尴尬地打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:37.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no clickety-clacking of high-heel shoes on hardwood floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:37.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有踩在木地板上 喀喀喀的高跟鞋声
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:42.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They may as well have been a family of cats just jumping around from drape to drape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:42.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们可能是一窝猫 在窗帘之间跳来跳去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:46.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And without that annoying ammonia-urine smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:46.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且没有讨厌的尿臊味
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.11,0:01:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure the new people will be just as quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.11,0:01:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我确定新来的会一样安静
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:53.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't know that. How can you possibly know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:53.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你才不知道 你怎么可能会知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.45,0:01:56.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right, I can't. You know what? Anyone could rent that apartment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.45,0:01:56.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说的没错 我不知道 现在谁都可以租那间公寓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:02:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An opera singer, the cast of Stomp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:02:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}歌剧演唱家 打击秀的演员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:05.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, a tap-dancing pirate with a wooden leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:05.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 还有跳踢跶舞的海盗 装了一只木腿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:08.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you making it worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.92,0:02:08.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么要让情况变得更糟？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:11.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I tried making it better, he wouldn't go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:11.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来想弄得好一点 但是他不接受啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.55,0:02:12.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[INAUDIBLE]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're right. That's a great idea. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你说得对 真是好主意 -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:18.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll take the apartment. I can finally get away from my mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:18.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来租那间公寓 终于可以脱离我妈的魔掌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:21.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and we can all spend some more time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:21.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且我们也可以有多一点时间混在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.56,0:02:23.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you catch my drift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.56,0:02:23.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你能了解我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恐怖极了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:53.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:53.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:56.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you honestly expect me to believe social protocol dictates...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:56.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的要我相信社交礼仪规定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:03:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we break our backs helping Wolowitz move, and he only need buy us a pizza?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:03:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们努力的帮沃洛维茨搬家 而他只要请我们吃披萨就好？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, that really is how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 事情就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're tricking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在唬我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:10.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Tell me the truth, what do we get? -Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:10.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说实话 我们可以拿到什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, help me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 帮我一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You get to choose between a mountain bike or a PS3.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以选择要山地车或是PS3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:18.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:18.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:21.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-PS3, definitely PS3. -Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:21.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然是PS3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:23.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who would pick a mountain bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:23.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁会选山地车啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Enough with the guilt, Ma. We'll still see each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要再拿罪恶感压我 妈 我们还是会见面的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:31.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll come over every night and have dinner with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:31.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会每天晚上过来陪你吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:34.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: The hell you will!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:34.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会才怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:38.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What am I running here, a fancy restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:38.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你以为我在开高级餐厅吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:41.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does this look like Olive Garden?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:41.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里看起来像橄榄园吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:44.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Okay, I get it, you're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:44.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 我知道了 你很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:48.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't wanna see your little bird leave the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:48.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不希望看到你的小鸟离巢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:51.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Little bird? You're almost 30!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:51.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小鸟？你已经快三十了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fly for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就快飞走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:57.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Fine, I'll stay. You happy, crazy lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:57.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我不搬了 高兴了吗 疯女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:04:00.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I sure as hell hope so, because you're ruining my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:04:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望你高兴 因为你毁了我一生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR SLAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:07.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Penny, it's Leonard. Good news, you can take your head out of the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:07.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我是莱纳德 好消息 你可以不用躲在烤箱里了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:10.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess I won't be needing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:10.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我不需要这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:21.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}新房客
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN SINGSONG VOICE] They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们搬来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:28.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stay calm. We don't know anything about them yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别紧张 我们还不了解他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[OBJECTS RATTLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.94,0:04:35.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you doing? -I'm checking for musical instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.94,0:04:35.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在做什么？ -我在看有没有乐器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does that sound like castanets to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.82,0:04:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这听起来像不像响板？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The box says "kitchen."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盒子上写的是〝厨房〞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:45.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So? Do cocaine smugglers write "cocaine" on the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:45.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又怎样？难道走私犯 会在盒子上标明〝可卡因〞？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:49.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello? -Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:49.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们好 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:51.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello. -Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:51.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello. -Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:57.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Alicia. I'm moving in upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:57.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是艾丽莎 我搬到楼上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:59.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:59.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm Leonard. I live downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是莱纳德 我住楼下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.89,0:05:04.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Upstairs from here, but under you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.89,0:05:04.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里的楼上 你的下面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:08.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not under you per se...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:08.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是在你的下面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but under your apartment. Heh-heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是在你的公寓下面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.77,0:05:13.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's nice. -Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.77,0:05:13.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真不错 -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:18.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that concludes your faltering attempt to mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:18.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你畏缩的求偶举动到此结束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:23.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello. -Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:23.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:24.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.28,0:05:24.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:30.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On a scale of one to ten, how light of foot would you describe yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:30.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以一个十分的量表 形容你的脚步有多轻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:35.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with one being not cat-like at all, and ten being freakishly feline?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:35.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一分代表一点都不像猫 十分代表非常像猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:37.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Freakishly feline?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:37.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常像猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:40.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that your answer or do you not understand the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:40.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你的答案 还是你不了解问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:43.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We'll come back to that one. -Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:43.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们等下再讨论这一题 -谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on. Are you now or have you ever been a salsa, Irish-folk or breakdancer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 你现在或曾经跳过莎莎舞 爱尔兰民族舞蹈或是霹雳舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:52.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -You're making her uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:52.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -你让她感到不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:53.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did--? Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:53.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:58.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, if it helps you feel any better, you're doing very well so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:58.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果这样说能让你感觉好一点 你目前表现得还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.23,0:06:00.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Next question. Are you fertile?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.23,0:06:00.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}下一个问题 你能生孩子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -I'm trying to determine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -我想确定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:06.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...whether crying infants are a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:06.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哭闹婴儿的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:10.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I have no immediate plans. -If that changes, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:10.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我现在还不想生 -如果改变主意 请通知我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-And finally, area rugs, pro or con? -Pro?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-最后的问题 赞不赞成铺小地毯 -赞成？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Alicia? -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-艾丽莎？ -什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:16.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Welcome to the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:16.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欢迎你住进来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:28.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks so much for helping me, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.80,0:06:28.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真谢谢你的帮忙 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Thank you so much for giving me the opportunity to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你给我这个机会帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:35.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:35.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:37.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny, this is Alicia, our new neighbor. -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:37.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 她是新邻居艾丽莎 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:39.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.11,0:06:39.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.82,0:06:43.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.82,0:06:43.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:47.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alicia's non-musical, childless and pro-rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:47.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾丽莎没有乐器和小孩 而且赞成铺地毯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's still on probation, of course, but I like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她还在观察期 但我喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:53.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cool T-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.29,0:06:53.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很酷的上衣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.70,0:06:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, I don't usually dress like this. I'm going jogging.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.70,0:06:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我平常不会这么穿 我要去慢跑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:00.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You don't jog. -I can start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:00.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你又不慢跑 -我可以开始跑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.63,0:07:04.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The more likely explanation for your attire is that you're out of clean clothes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.63,0:07:04.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 但更有可能的解释是 你又没有干净的衣服可以换了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:07.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you, Sheldon. -You're welcome, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:07.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢 谢尔顿 -不客气 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please, you look cute. I'm dressed like a slob today too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 你看起来很可爱 我今天也穿得很邋遢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:12.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: I think you look fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得你看起来美呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-This one's a player, huh? -Oh, yeah, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他是一个花花公子 对吧？ -是啊 小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thanks for the warning. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:22.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢谢你的警告 -不会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'll see you around. -See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:24.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-下次见 -再见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:27.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KEYS JINGLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN MOCKING VOICE] "I'm dressed like a slob today too."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我今天也穿得很邋遢〞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, mimicry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}模仿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.37,0:07:33.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I enjoy mimicry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.37,0:07:33.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很喜欢模仿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:36.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been working on Admiral Ackbar from Return of the Jedi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:36.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直在练习模仿 《绝地大反攻》的亚克博上将
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LOUDLY] It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to imagine me with a giant squid head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要想像我有个大乌贼头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:53.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:53.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:58.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:58.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:02.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:26.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCK ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:27.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:29.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:32.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 -恭喜你洗衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:32.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Congratulations, I see you did your laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也算是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:36.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How does one sort of--? -I bought new clothes, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:36.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是什么意思… -我买新衣服可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:40.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is Leonard around? -He's upstairs at Alicia's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:40.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德在吗？ -他在楼上艾丽莎家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:42.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, all right, that's cool, no biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:42.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 没关系 没什么大事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.86,0:08:46.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He said he'd help me set up my printer, but I guess I can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.86,0:08:46.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说要帮我安装打印机 我想我可以等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:47.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What exactly is he doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:47.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他到底在那里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In what I can only perceive as a tactical move to destroy me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想他们正在进行一项 毁掉我的战略
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:54.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he is with Wolowitz and Koothrappali setting up her stereo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:54.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他和沃洛维茨跟库萨帕里 在帮她架设音响
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, they're all up there, huh? Hmm. Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:58.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们都在楼上吧？很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:01.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's axiomatically atypical.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:01.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这根本就是不正常
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:07.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Until recently, they did not know Alicia, and had no encounters in a previous location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:07.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们最近才认识艾丽莎 他们以前从未见过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They never went to visit the former tenants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们从来没拜访过前任房客
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:14.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So your characterization of their behavior as typical is demonstrably fallacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:14.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说他们的行为很正常 根本是显而易见的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, now I see the giant squid head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 现在我可以看到你的大乌贼头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:24.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR OPENS THEN CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:29.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, great. Now I have to start all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:29.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是好极了 现在我又得重头开始
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:33.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I thought about renting this apartment...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:33.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我曾考虑要租下这间公寓
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:38.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I'm really more of a downtown-loft kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:38.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我比较属于那种 住在城里阁楼的那种人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cool. So are you in a loft now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真酷 你现在住在阁楼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:43.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, actually I'm living with a woman in Altadena.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:43.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实我跟一个女人住在阿塔狄纳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Purely platonic. She's also my maid. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们之间很清白 她也是我的女佣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:51.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sounds like a sweet deal. -Well, I won't lie. It's pretty dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:51.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-听起来真不错 -我不骗你 还挺赞的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:56.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:56.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:09:59.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. I just wanted to bring you a housewarming gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:09:59.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是来送乔迁礼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:01.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:01.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:03.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Come on in. Let's open it. -Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:03.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-进来吧 开来一起喝 -太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:07.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Nice dress. -Oh, this? I'm dressed like a slob today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好漂亮的衣服 -这件吗？我今天穿得很邋遢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.15,0:10:11.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The guys have been helping me set up my sound system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.15,0:10:11.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们一直在帮我架设音响系统
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:14.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've never had such good-looking technical support.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:14.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从来都没遇过这么帅的 技术人员来帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, pish posh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:19.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[INAUDIBLE]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:22.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. It means shucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:22.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 意思是不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shucks means shucks. Let one go once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不重要的意思就是不重要 可不可以不要追根究底
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:29.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, you wanna hear something awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:29.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 你想不想知道一件很棒的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah. -Alicia is an actress just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好啊 -艾丽莎跟你一样是演员
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:35.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:35.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:40.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, trying to be, but it's so hard. -I know, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:40.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我是想当演员 但真的很难 -我知道 还用说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:43.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been here three months. All I've gotten is a couple commercials.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:43.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经来这里三个月了 我只拍了几支大广告
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:45.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And this recurring thing on a soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:45.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在连续剧里当半固定演员而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:53.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why I work at The Cheesecake Factory. I'm holding out for the right part.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:53.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我才在芝乐坊上班 我在等适合我的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:11:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alicia, what do you want as your default setting for DVDs, 5.1 Dolby or DTS?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:11:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾丽莎 你想要光碟机怎么设定？ 立体音效还是数字剧院音响系统？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:03.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whatever you think is best, cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:03.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}交给你处理就好 帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:05.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GIGGLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:10.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, DTS has more low-end...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:10.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}数字剧院音响系统比较低端…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以…好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys, you will really appreciate this. I read the best science joke on the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 你们一定会喜欢听这个 我在网上看到一个最棒的科学笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:22.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alicia, you won't get it, but it's right up their alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾丽莎 你可能听不懂 但是正合他们的口味
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:25.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, so this physicist goes into an ice cream parlor every week...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:25.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一个物理学家 每个礼拜都到冰激凌店去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:28.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...orders an ice cream sundae for himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:28.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}点一份圣代自己吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and offers one to the empty stool next to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一份给旁边空无一人的座位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:33.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This goes on until the owner asks him what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:33.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一阵子以后 老板问他为什么要这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.74,0:11:36.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The man says, "Well, I'm a physicist...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.74,0:11:36.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说：〝我是一个物理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:39.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and quantum mechanics teaches us...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:39.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}量子力学教导我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:43.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that it is possible for the matter above this stool...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:43.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个座位上的物质很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to spontaneously turn into a beautiful woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自然形成一个美女
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who might accept my offer and fall in love."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她可能会接受我的冰激凌 然后爱上我〞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The owner then says, "Lots of women come in here every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老板就说 〝这里每天都有很多女人进来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.59,0:11:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you buy an ice cream for them, and they might fall in love?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.59,0:11:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不请她们吃冰激凌 她们可能会爱上你？〞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:56.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the physicist says:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:56.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后物理学家就说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.51,0:11:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Yeah, but what are the odds of that happening?" Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.51,0:11:59.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝是啊 但发生的机率有多高？〞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:07.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a little insulting, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:07.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不觉得有点侮辱人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How would I know? I'm not even sure I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么会知道？ 我都不确定我能听懂这个笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:13.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:13.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:16.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're done with the DVD player, can you set up my printer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:16.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}光碟机设定好之后 可以帮我弄打印机吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啊 我很乐意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:22.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When you're done with her printer, you could set up mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:22.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你设完她的印表机后或许可以帮我设
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:25.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, like you promised, a week ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你答应我的 大约一个礼拜之前？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.33,0:12:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'll get to it. Don't nag me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.33,0:12:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦 我会弄 别烦我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:33.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MUSIC PLAYS OVER TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:44.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MAN SPEAKS INDISTINCTLY OVER TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:55.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hello, Penny. It's open. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 佩妮 门没关 进来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:59.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sarcasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:59.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}讽刺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:03.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, they're all still up there. -You think I can't hear them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:03.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他们还在楼上 -你以为我听不见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:07.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen to that. Stomp, stomp, stomp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:07.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你听 碰碰碰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Wolowitz in his stacked heels that fool no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是沃洛维茨穿着他的增高鞋 骗不了人的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.17,0:13:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't even know why I care. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.17,0:13:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道为什么要在乎 我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.25,0:13:19.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I cared enough to memorize that stupid joke, but that's all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.25,0:13:19.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我在乎到去记那个蠢笑话 但仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:21.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:21.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.43,0:13:25.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...there's something that occurs in beehives you might find interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.43,0:13:25.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有件蜂巢中发生的事情 你或许会觉得很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:30.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Occasionally, a new queen will arrive while the old queen is still in power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:30.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时 老的蜂后还在时 新的蜂后就来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:34.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When this happens, the old queen must either locate to a new hive...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:34.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生这种事的时候 老蜂后不是另觅新巢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:40.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or engage in a battle to the death until only one queen remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:40.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是奋战到死 直到只剩一名蜂后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you saying? That I'm threatened by Alicia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在说什么？我受到艾丽莎的威胁？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:49.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That I'm like the old queen of the hive, and it's just time for me to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:49.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就像是老蜂后 现在是我该离开的时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:52.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just talking about bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:52.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是在说蜜蜂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're on The Discovery Channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}探索频道正在播
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:58.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:58.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:01.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:01.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蜜蜂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:08.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚明白物理学家的笑话了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:08.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just got that physicist joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:13.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Gee, Penny, thanks for buying us dinner. PENNY: Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:13.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 谢谢你请我们吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.14,0:14:16.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, what's the occasion? -No occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.14,0:14:16.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是啊 庆祝什么？ -没庆祝什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just felt like getting some Chinese chow for my peeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是想请我的朋友吃中国菜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:24.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you remember to ask for the chicken to be diced not shredded?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:24.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你记得我要鸡肉丁 而不是鸡肉丝？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even though the menu specifies shredded?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然菜单上注明是鸡肉丝？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.24,0:14:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Brown rice, not white? Stop at the grocery and get the mustard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.24,0:14:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是糙米饭 不是白米饭？ 到杂货店去买芥末酱？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:31.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pick up the low-sodium soy sauce from the market?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:31.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去超市买低钠酱油？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:33.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:33.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See how it's done, Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看人家是怎么做事的 莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:41.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do we got going on tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:41.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们今晚有什么节目？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:45.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Playing Halo? Watching Battlestar? Drop some Mentos in Diet Coke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:45.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}玩《光晕》？看《星际大争霸》？ 还是把曼妥思丢进健怡可乐？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:48.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wanna watch Battlestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:48.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想看《星际大争霸》？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:52.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What can I say? I got my geek on, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:52.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还能说什么？ 我现在跟你们是同一伙的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:54.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCK ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:58.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, PMS is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:58.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 经前症候群跟这个不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:02.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank God you're home. I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:02.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好你在家 我需要帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:04.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's wrong? -I got a callback to audition for CSI...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:04.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -我有《犯罪现场调查》的试演
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.95,0:15:08.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...to play a hooker who gets killed. -Oh, I'd watch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.95,0:15:08.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-要演一个被杀的妓女 -我会看的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:13.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But my car is in the shop and I have to be at Universal in 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:13.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我的车在修理 我必须四十五分钟内赶到环球片场
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:17.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, well, I'll take you. ALICIA: Oh, you're a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:17.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 我带你去 -你真是我的救星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:19.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'll run lines with you in the car. ALICIA: Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:19.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我可以跟你在车里对戏 -太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:22.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And afterward, I'll take you all out for Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.71,0:15:22.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结束之后 我带大家去吃中国菜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:26.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Actually, that's okay. We already have-- LEONARD: I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:26.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不用了 我们已经有… -我饿死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:28.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:31.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}--Chinese food right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:31.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}中国菜在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:34.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're gone, Penny. They can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:34.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们走了 佩妮 听不到你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:39.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I cannot believe they're letting her just use them like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:39.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真不敢相信 他们让她这样子利用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:43.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything she wants, they go panting after her like trained dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:43.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她想做什么 他们就像训练过的狗跟在旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:46.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just last week, she had Howard drive to her uncle's house...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:46.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上礼拜她叫霍华德开车送她到叔叔家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in Orange County to pick up her TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去橙县拿她的电视
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:52.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You once had Leonard and me get your television from your ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:52.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有一次叫莱纳德和我 去你前男友家拿电视
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:56.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Apples and oranges here, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:56.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这根本不能相提并论 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:16:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm telling you, that girl is a user, skating through life on her looks...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:16:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉你 她很会利用人 用她的外表让她一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...taking advantage of innocent men...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}占老实人的便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:05.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...getting auditions for stupid network shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}得到有线网节目的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:08.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It just creams my corn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:08.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抢了我的风头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-May I interject something here? -Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我可以插个嘴吗？ -请说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.97,0:16:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got the wrong mustard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.97,0:16:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你买错芥末酱了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:21.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:21.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 -你好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guess what? I got the part on CSI.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你猜怎样？ 我拿到《犯罪现场调查》的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:28.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:30.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. You know what? Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:30.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:33.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you'll make a great hooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:33.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你会成为很好的妓女
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:35.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:35.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:38.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I gotta ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:38.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要问你一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How much do physicists make?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些物理学家赚多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um.... Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:46.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. I don't think a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:46.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 应该不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:48.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that's what I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:48.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 我也这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.55,0:16:51.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, gotta run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.55,0:16:51.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:55.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The guys promised to set up my satellite dish and paint my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:56.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们答应要帮我装卫星接收器 还有油漆我的卧房
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:57.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:17:00.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey. Hey, can I talk to you about that for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:17:00.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以跟你谈一下那件事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.39,0:17:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.39,0:17:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.23,0:17:05.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you know, it's just that Leonard and Howard and Raj...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.23,0:17:05.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 霍华德和拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:07.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...they aren't like other guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:07.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们跟其他人不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're special.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.86,0:17:12.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, they're special, and...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.86,0:17:12.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 他们很特别 然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see. How can I explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该怎么解释呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.41,0:17:19.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-They don't know how to use their shields. -Shields?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.41,0:17:19.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他们不知道怎么使用防护罩 -防护罩？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.04,0:17:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you know, like in Star Trek when you're in battle and you raise the shields?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.04,0:17:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 就像《星际迷航》一样 打仗的时候要升起防护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:30.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where the hell did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:30.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么会说出这种话？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyways, you know how guys like this are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:34.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之 你应该了解 像这样的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So please don't take advantage of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以拜托不要占他们便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who says I'm taking advantage of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁说我占他们便宜？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:47.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, they're doing everything for you because you're leading them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:47.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 你引诱他们为你做一大堆事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:49.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I let them do stuff for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:49.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我让他们帮我做一些事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:50.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're happy, I get stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:50.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们很高兴 我也得到东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:53.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who cares? And how is it any different from what you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:53.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁在乎啊？ 这跟你的行为又有什么不同？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:58.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:58.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再说一次？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've seen you around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看过你在他们身边的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:03.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you pretending like you don't do the exact same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:03.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在假装说你不会做这种事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:07.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, lady, you are way out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 小姐 你太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.25,0:18:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, I'm out of line? -Yeah, you're out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.25,0:18:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我太过分了？ -是的 你太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, what are you gonna do about it, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你想怎么样呢 臭女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:21.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like Green Lantern.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:21.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢绿灯侠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:25.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just saying it's pretty lame that he can be defeated by the color yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.18,0:18:25.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为他会被黄色打败真的很扯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:28.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Only the modern Green Lantern is vulnerable to yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:28.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有摩登时代的绿灯侠怕黄色
